{"server":"cn","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_06_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_06","title":"无人知晓","storyCode":"FC-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"6ccc4f059864b6426c0881192b4f5d7b53631613f5b30f9586df6487703ba423","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什么，但你的大呼小叫可不会分散我们的注意力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？那边似乎有打起来的响动，你们不用去支援？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"安静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，别对我大喊大叫的，维多利亚人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"安静，不然小心自己的头骨碎开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......维多利亚人，凭什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"不要太把自己当回事，塔拉人。我对你们没有什么偏见或者仇恨，最多觉得你们可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不过是一支被利用的政治势力，公爵的一枚棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"出于礼貌，我们对你们已经很友善，但要知道，一帮流民死在这里，不会给我们带来任何损失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......来命令了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"如果需要支援，我们就按照队长的安排，先处理这里的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"目标往一队方向逃脱，一二队保持追击，其余人后撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"给她们会合的机会，一并逮捕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苇草，你是怎么摆脱那个调查官的？我跟陈陈正要去救你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别发呆呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边人少，我们抓紧机会突围！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其他人......还在树林那边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是。我们先想办法冲出去，然后去救他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——有弩手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你们真以为能逃脱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些弩手之前没有出手过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还有埋伏，数量未知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能被这么多精锐战力迎接，真挺有排面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是不管有多少人，现在也只能一个一个打过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......等等，风笛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除我们之外，他们还要面对其他对手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你说得对。他们在调度队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......执行很快，应该是事先确定的作战计划。眼前可能是有意留给我们的缺口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，这荒野上难道还有人会来吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"敌对武装部队出现！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"投弹准备，警惕诱饵小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从黑夜中现身的部队，与小丘郡街道上浮现的鬼魂如出一辙。\n风笛握紧了手中的破城矛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......深池。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"已经确认敌方指挥官身份，和您的设想一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赤铁近卫队队长......他以深池的身份来搭救那条德拉克了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和我的猜测一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情可能变成两位大公爵明面上的冲突，而那位铁公爵为自己寻找的战场应该是特伦特郡城内，他们不会在这种时刻太过冒进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续等待时机吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"发现目标，优先抓捕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你的武器......你是维多利亚军人？她身边居然有维多利亚军人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，很奇怪吗？这里到处都是维多利亚的军人呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"先将三人分开！不要跟目标外的人过多纠缠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"——目标已经在我们的控制之下，三队带目标回撤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目标......你们说的是，苇草？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，拉芙希妮......我们算是老朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太紧张，也别激动，你应该不喜欢用暴力的方式来问候久别重逢的朋友，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，你本来是可以离开的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道，领袖已经默许了你的逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想带我走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不可能回去，那里也不会再有我的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那里......从来就没有我的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你不喜欢自己影子的身份，你不相信那群由自己说出的谎言召集起来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是深池的话，你还能去哪里？作为一条德拉克，你要去哪里安身呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉芙希妮，可怜的拉芙希妮......我其实是真心同情你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，只有在谈到那些虚构的诗歌、华而不实的文字时，你才会对我多说几句话，就像真的老朋友一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有自己的生活，你想要像诗人一样走遍古老的原野，或者只是困在狭小的旧屋里，成天读书，以抄写为生......那都是很好的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样看来，那艘舰船上的生活，应该是很让人满意的呀。你为什么不乖乖地躲好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......领袖她知道，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在小丘郡，那些野心家的阴谋，害死了许多无辜的平民。她......是不是早就知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己就是最了解她的人，为什么还要找我确认呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们如果没有死在小丘郡的混战之中，领袖原本也会亲自动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜。就像“雄辩家”他们，如果在小丘郡乖乖执行命令，不做什么小动作，原本还可以在领袖身边多活几日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉如果在伦蒂尼姆办好领袖交代的事，把“间谍”带回来，原本不必凄惨地死在下水道旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而你如果就那样逃离你的命运，躲藏起来，原本我也不会想把你带回深池呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该庆幸，先找到你的是我，我愿意给你时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果现在站在你面前的是“校官”，在你犹豫的那一刻他就会杀了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他们只想让我当影子，我不会再过那种生活......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"在灰烬中挥动长枪，一定比刺穿血肉的身躯要容易得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——！这一下应该足够让你们起不来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苇草，你怎么样——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"每一次施术时，苇草都会闭上眼睛。\n但风笛不会。风笛看见了枪尖燃起的那簇火焰。\n对了，自己不是在小丘郡见过她吗？那个深池的术师站在广场的雕像下，冷漠地注视着被火焰焚烧的街道，注视着无数人的生死。\n自己只是相信Outcast，相信罗德岛......所以不愿意相信自己那一瞥的印象。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛，你那边怎么样？能把深池的人和情报部门的打手引到一起吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不许你去抓苇草！给我让开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"风笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在招架与攻击之间的片刻喘息里，她下意识地再次回头。\n一阵雾气漫过她的视野，横亘在她和苇草之间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲舍尔","speakerId":"avg_4017_puzzle_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，利用好烟雾掩护，切入战场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石技艺，警惕起来，缩紧阵型！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"重新确认方位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，“校官”，您到了......是，下面交给您指挥......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她要逃出去。烟雾给了她机会，她熟知让局势变为混战的策略。她只需要挥动长枪，驱使火焰。\n可那之后呢？\n她是深池的“领袖”。\n她代表深池的火焰，焚烧过无数土地，取走过许多性命。\n她用自己的声音说出虚幻的承诺，在演讲中一次次地宣称自己会带来属于塔拉人的时代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"一队直接突击，不要害怕伤害目标人物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特别行动队士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"德拉克的生理耐受性很优秀，几道伤口杀不死她！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她是一条德拉克。\n她的父母为这血统死在节日的大雪夜，她和姐姐辗转流浪过数座城市，怀着重现旧日王朝野心的政治家编排她们的成长。\n她的火焰与生俱来，至今仍然让她的五脏六腑灼痛。\n她逃到哪里，才能从那样的命运里逃出去？\n她曾经在罗德岛的病床上醒来，倚着床栏读书。那些文字里有维多利亚精致的和平，塔拉悠扬的牧歌。\n但是，受伤的同伴就从她的窗外走过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"就算闭上眼睛，她也能看见那座城市的废墟。她被救了出来，而许多人死在那里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"动手吧，队长下令了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"处理掉这些，再去处理深池的家伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，塔拉人。刀很快的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，维恩！我就知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——哪里来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来，来帮帮我啊！救命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起来！能站起来的都起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是捆住手嘛，我们人多！三个士兵而已，还有个受伤了的，咱们打得过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！我们上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"跟那天一样！咱们能撂倒那些来村子里巡逻的维多利亚兵，就能撂倒他们几个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，维恩，你怎么挣脱的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我蹲在那边看苇草的情况，没人发现，我就悄悄用石头把绳子磨断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，想想就后怕，要是我回来得晚了一点，该怎么办呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就别想。帮我把绳子松开，然后去帮其他人，快点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要好好教训一下这个傲慢的维多利亚佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说我们只是被利用？可悲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，我身上的伤，我擦干过的血和泪，没有比这更实在的东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又——凭什么对塔拉人指手画脚？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"报告给，队长！人质暴动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——应该是放倒了吧？抱歉，我看得不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你力气还挺大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有谁被捆着的？我拿这个维多利亚人的刀帮你割开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点，刚刚他把消息传出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费加尔，你去听着那边有没有士兵追过来。维恩，来帮忙扶一把受伤的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，能走的先走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"逃难的塔拉人跌跌撞撞地摸索着，跑向树林的更深处。\n他们逃离了家乡，逃离了那片泥泞的土地，却没有人知道要跑得多快，才能将战火与死亡甩在身后。\n逃出这片黑夜，是不是就能重新建起安宁的家园？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，维恩，你是会写字的，到时帮我写封信寄回去，我得让家里人知道我还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我说好了要酿接骨木酒，你得替我从集市上弄一套酿酒的东西回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我记下了。没有账本我也记下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"接着，他们不约而同地停下了脚步。\n有人轻轻吹起了口哨。\n塔拉人有很多说不出的事情，他们找不到词语的时候，就只好歌唱。\n唱他们缺酒的酒杯，不在此处的亲爱之人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞尔蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看着他们打起来了，深池的人也来了。他们都是去抓苇草的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风笛和陈在帮忙，可是只有她们三个人，是不是不太够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我闻到味道了。那边那么大的烟，估计是柴火没烧好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我们搞不好正好能混进去，对吧，塞尔蒙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。拿上维多利亚人的刀，路上看到的武器，我们都拿上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们刚放倒了那几个当兵的，没什么好怕的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们也不是要打仗，不用把他们都干掉，只要把苇草她们救出来就行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞尔蒙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫兰，你看得见吗？要是那火不够亮，我牵着你走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烟越来越浓，热浪越来越近。\n林木在燃烧，生命在消逝。\n没有人叫到过他们的名字。\n没有人问过他们的梦想，问他们是不是正与梦想的生活背道而驰。\n他们朝眼前唯一的火光奔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苇草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“苇草”。他们在叫我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
